            "body": "Closing this one. It's a C++ change (`csrc/custom_all_reduce.cuh`) that I was never able to actually compile and benchmark — the dev environment here uses `VLLM_USE_PRECOMPILED=1`, which doesn't rebuild this extension, so this PR's claim has never been validated against real measurements, unlike the sibling movedim PRs in this same area where I did run isolated + end-to-end benchmarks (#61136/#61138/#61139/#61140). Without that evidence this doesn't meet the bar I'm now holding the rest of this batch to, so closing rather than leaving an unverified perf claim open.",
